    "teacherReflection": "Which learners could explain, using Biuret colours and Table 1 values, why ugali stays blue yet beans turn violet? Did groups confuse protein with the main energy store? How well did the paper-clip chain help learners see amino acids joined together? Were safety routines with the reagent followed by every group? Which new DQB questions (for example about enzymes and lipids) should be highlighted for Lessons 4 and 5? What would I change to give quieter learners more speaking time?",
