      "purposeInStoryline": "Lessons 2 to 4 showed that ugali and beans contain carbohydrates, proteins and lipids. Lesson 5 answers the next question: how can the body use big molecules such as starch? Enzymes break them into small molecules that can be absorbed. This adds digestion to the class model and prepares Lesson 6, where learners compare meals using evidence.",
