      "safetyNotes": "This is a data and discussion lesson, so no chemical tests are carried out. If any food samples are shown, no tasting of anything that has been in the laboratory. Keep walkways clear during gallery walks. Be sensitive to learners who may not have regular meals at home: talk about 'an athlete's meal', not 'your meal'."
